    println!("      2. **Latency**: Time per individual operation");
    println!("      3. **Memory**: Peak and steady-state usage");
    println!("      4. **Cache**: L1/L2/L3 cache hit rates");
    println!("      5. **Scalability**: Performance vs capacity");
