// But in practice, recursion depth = corridor length:
// - 50×50 grid, single-cell corridor = SAFE (2,500 depth)
// - 100×100 grid, single-cell corridor = RISKY (10,000 depth)
// - 200×200 grid = ❌ CERTAIN CRASH
